<title>BRAZIL: Brazil monthly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazil monthly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the month ending January 31 compared with the previous month and the corresponding month last year in tonnes.</p>
<p>Month ending  Month ending  Month ending</p>
<p> .	  31/01/97     31/12/96     31/01/96</p>
<p> Bean	  nil	    nil	    nil</p>
<p> Meal	396,900	390,800	554,300</p>
<p> Oil	  58,300	 33,500	 29,700</p>
